建“合并事件-源告警-证据文件”的可回溯映射关系表，确保合并逻辑完整留痕。\\n5. 将合并事件清单、关联源告警明细及证据追溯映射表整合为结构化交付文档，明确标注各事件的时间跨度、覆盖位置、识别目标及各项相似度依据，输出符合安防巡检规范的重复事件合并结果报表。\\n场景任务：\\n- video_surveillance: 我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警重复事件，并保留合并依据。；参数：{'视频对象': '这批摄像头', '监控目标': '合并重复事件', '输出形式': '保留合并依据'}\\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '这批摄像头', '监控目标': '合并重复事件', '输出形式': '保留合并依据'}\\n任务提示：\\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"8ebbc7fe-4de5-4ee1-bb5d-34e30a62d903","tool_call_id":"call_51c329ee3de2451887dfd522","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":163,"prompt_tokens":14984,"total_tokens":15147,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":94,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":163},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":14984}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-cd693d17-8ec8-9fb0-a78a-f6b9c3ba7636","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e17-c1f4-7d10-9a7e-7b574b4e4a0c-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取重复事件合并 Skill 文件，了解输入格式和执行流程","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_8ca884635cf44460a8c9231e","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":14984,"output_tokens":163,"total_tokens":15147,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":94}}},{"content":"---\nname: duplicate-event-merge\ndescription: Merge duplicate video event candidates from the same camera, event type, ROI, evidence frames, or overlapping time window. Use after single-video-event-analysis or batch video analysis when Codex has a list of Event Candidate records and needs canonical events plus duplicate mappings.\n---\n\n# Duplicate Event Merge\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf event candidates are missing but the user provided a video or upstream analysis request, first call `single-video-event-analysis` to produce candidate events, then call this skill to merge duplicates. Only ask for input when no event candidates can be produced or inferred.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython duplicate-event-merge/scripts/run.py --events-json <events.json> --output <merged_events.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--events-json`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read event candidates.\n2. Build duplicate keys from camera, event type, ROI, and related tracks.\n3. Merge confidence and time range.\n4. Return canonical events and duplicate mapping.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `events`: list of Event Candidate dictionaries\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns:\n- `events`: canonical merged events\n- `duplicates`: mappings of `main_event_id` to `merged_event_id`\n\n## Failure Modes\n\nThe current implementation tolerates empty input and returns empty outputs.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not drop evidence metadata from the canonical event.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"415998cb-188d-4418-98e0-2c2d602acc8f","tool_call_id":"call_8ca884635cf44460a8c9231e","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":165,"prompt_tokens":15479,"total_tokens":15644,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":81,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":165},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":15479}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-f8729570-24ed-9d63-b01f-9c054baad4f0","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e17-dbe3-72a0-996d-af5854be2aae-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ls -la /mnt/user-data/uploads/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la /mnt/user-data/workspace/ 2>/dev/null","description":"检查是否有用户上传的告警数据文件或工作区中的相关文件"},"id":"call_deeead5a70ea4430b9aa2e9d","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":15479,"output_tokens":165,"total_tokens":15644,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":81}}},{"content":"total 8\ndrwxrwxrwx 2 root root 4096 Jul 26 19:03 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 root root 4096 Jul 26 19:03 ..\n---\ntotal 8\ndrwxrwxrwx 2 root root 4096 Jul 26 19:03 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 root root 4096 Jul 26 19:03 ..","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"df62f3bb-fc8e-4206-abd1-d3d709039dc6","tool_call_id":"call_deeead5a70ea4430b9aa2e9d","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":162,"prompt_tokens":15693,"total_tokens":15855,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":60,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":162},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":15693}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-5f7b3e99-b2a8-9b0d-8bea-09a62d14b2d0","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e17-e92b-7331-9630-442cc8f7f51a-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"find /mnt/datasets -maxdepth 3 -type f \\( -name \"*.json\" -o -name \"*.csv\" -o -name \"*.log\" -o -name \"*.txt\" \\) 2>/dev/null | head -30","description":"检查内置数据集中是否有告警相关的数据文件"},"id":"call_9588a577dab5439c8cbe0b84","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":15693,"output_tokens":162,"total_tokens":15855,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":60}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","normalized_query":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警重复事件，并保留合并依据","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"合并重复事件","输出形式":"保留合并依据"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_c1883f","text":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_e2e0b3","text":"读取该批次摄像头上报的原始告警日志，结构化解析并提取时间戳、GPS/区域位置、目标类别与特征描述、证据文件路径及唯一告警ID等字段，输出标准化告警数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_10eae1","text":"基于标准化数据集计算多维相似度指标，按时间差值、地理空间距离、目标属性匹配度及视频/图像证据相似度评分进行两两比对，设定各维度判定阈值与加权规则，输出带相似度特征的告警特征表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_692320","text":"依据设定的四维相似度阈值与判定口径对告警特征表执行聚类分析与事件去重，将满足合并条件的相似告警聚合为独立事件簇，生成包含主告警标识与关联告警ID列表的合并事件清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_e90f4d","text":"针对每个合并事件簇自动归集支撑该次合并的原始告警记录与对应视频帧或截图证据，构建“合并事件-源告警-证据文件”的可回溯映射关系表，确保合并逻辑完整留痕。"},{"task_span_id":"span_479ed9","text":"将合并事件清单、关联源告警明细及证据追溯映射表整合为结构化交付文档，明确标注各事件的时间跨度、覆盖位置、识别目标及各项相似度依据，输出符合安防巡检规范的重复事件合并结果报表。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_a412c6","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警重复事件，并保留合并依据。","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"合并重复事件","输出形式":"保留合并依据"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_a412c6","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并这批摄像头上报的相似告警重复事件，并保留合并依据。","params":{"视频对象":"这批摄像头","监控目标":"合并重复事件","输出形式":"保留合并依据"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:b682f12b-178c-44e2-9a50-f2508e935217"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"这批摄像头上报了很多相似告警，请根据时间、地点、目标和证据相似度合并重复事件，并保留合并依据。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:b682f12b-178c-44e2-9a50-f2508e935217"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

